# Root .dockerignore — every osiris-* image builds with `context: .` (repo
# root), because at least one Dockerfile (api/Dockerfile, gw/Dockerfile)
# needs to COPY a file from outside its own subdirectory (omniroute/,
# console/). Without this file, `docker build`/`docker compose build` tars
# up console/node_modules (hundreds of MB, never referenced by any
# Dockerfile COPY) on every build — added while wiring gw/Dockerfile
# (console SPA baked into the osiris-gw image) after noticing the build
# context transfer step was the slowest part of an otherwise-fast build.
console/node_modules
console/dist
**/node_modules
.git
